  "contentHtml": "<p>오랫동안 재과만 선생님들의 도움을 많이 받고 이번에 처음 글을 올립니다.</p><p>중3 기말이 끝나고 한 달 정도 남아 이런저런 탐구 활동을 계획하고 있습니다.</p><p>기말 후 첫 수업으로 탐구 활동을 했는데 준비도 간단하고 아이들이 생각보다 열심히 해서 부끄럽지만 도움이 되실까 해서 올려요~&#160;</p><p>아래 사이트 참고했습니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/edu/resources/project/make-a-paper-mars-helicopter-2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/edu/resources/project/make-a-paper-mars-helicopter-2</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Make a Paper Mars Helicopter &#8211; Engineering Project | NASA JPL Education\" data-og-description=\"Build a paper helicopter, then see if you can improve the design like NASA engineers did when making the first helicopter for Mars.\" data-og-host=\"www.jpl.nasa.gov\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/edu/resources/project/make-a-paper-mars-helicopter-2\" data-og-url=\"https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/edu/resources/project/make-a-paper-mars-helicopter-2/\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cNcRqm/hyZOxC8C6m/qBVPpJyv9YK2rWunaOGJx0/img.png?width=800&amp;height=450&amp;face=0_0_800_450,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/9oXB0/hyZNA1Yd4y/uUexSTDOKtCzWsvvtylbzK/img.png?width=800&amp;height=450&amp;face=0_0_800_450,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cpVwQ5/hyZND5sLKJ/OVWXI6gorn9fNQqEPZr411/img.jpg?width=1024&amp;height=576&amp;face=0_0_1024_576\"><a href=\"https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/edu/resources/project/make-a-paper-mars-helicopter-2\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/edu/resources/project/make-a-paper-mars-helicopter-2\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cNcRqm/hyZOxC8C6m/qBVPpJyv9YK2rWunaOGJx0/img.png?width=800&amp;height=450&amp;face=0_0_800_450,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/9oXB0/hyZNA1Yd4y/uUexSTDOKtCzWsvvtylbzK/img.png?width=800&amp;height=450&amp;face=0_0_800_450,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cpVwQ5/hyZND5sLKJ/OVWXI6gorn9fNQqEPZr411/img.jpg?width=1024&amp;height=576&amp;face=0_0_1024_576\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Make a Paper Mars Helicopter &#8211; Engineering Project | NASA JPL Education</p><p class=\"og-desc\">Build a paper helicopter, then see if you can improve the design like NASA engineers did when making the first helicopter for Mars.</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.jpl.nasa.gov</p></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3439e076f3af403bb6b778e62c65e43f4c31ac6d?download\" data-file-name=\"paperhelicopter_worksheet.pdf\" data-file-size=\"157832\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D894%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20251126202522&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3439e076f3af403bb6b778e62c65e43f4c31ac6d')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">paperhelicopter_worksheet</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">154.13KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddd87c95e3251a10222fb7c4a68f199776c1f8b7?download\" data-file-name=\"도안.pdf\" data-file-size=\"146472\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D894%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20251126202522&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fddd87c95e3251a10222fb7c4a68f199776c1f8b7')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">도안</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">143.04KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"fi